  "content": "\n\n<p>為信標渲染光環。僅限客戶端模組。</p>\n<p>相容於大多數光影包。</p>\n<p>為更高階的信標渲染更大、更多的光環。可與其他能解鎖信標最高階的模組搭配使用。支援最高至第 16 階。</p>\n<p>相容 ModMenu。可變更光環樣式。</p>\n<p>暫無英文本地化。</p>\n<p>截圖：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RTqhJgFY/Screenshot-20251020-010137.png\" alt=\"alt text\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/JWt6HKwF/3b5fb0329283b216bc61af9d0bd1a92233134018.png\" alt=\"alt text\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Jw6N9FsK/Screenshot-20251020-010056.png\" alt=\"alt text\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/XqshmXW/Screenshot-20251020-010111.png\" alt=\"alt text\"></p>",
